- **`Promise.all` preserves order** — even though requests finish at different times, the output array matches the input array index-for-index.
- **`HEAD` by default** — avoids downloading bodies when you only need the status. Some servers reject `HEAD`; pass `{ method: 'GET' }` if needed.
- **`AbortController`** — prevents a single slow URL from hanging the whole batch.
